# Public repository: allowlist.
#
# Everything at the top level is ignored unless it is listed below, so a new
# file stays out of the repository until someone deliberately adds it here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/.editorconfig
!/global.json
!/Directory.Build.props
!/Directory.Build.targets
!/Directory.Packages.props
!/OneYaml.slnx
!/src/
!/tests/
!/bench/
!/tools/
!/docs/
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/LICENSE-MIT

# Never commit these anywhere in the tree.
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
TestResults/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
core
core.[0-9]*
vgcore.*
*.core
*.dmp
*.nettrace
*.speedscope.json
*.etl
*.trace
perf.data*
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
